{"id":"foire","lemma":"foire","pos":"noun","rank":2902,"glosses":["a fair, an exposition","artisans' market"],"ipa":"/fwaʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/83/Fr-foire.ogg/Fr-foire.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"foires"},"formAudio":{"foires":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/60/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-foires.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Allons à la foire.","en":"Let's go to the fair.","words":[{"g":"to go","l":"aller"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[1,3,"a la"]]},{"text":"Et si quelque chose foire ?","en":"What if something goes wrong?","words":[null,null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[0,2,"what if"],[2,4,"something"]]},{"text":"Ne le foire pas !","en":"Don't screw it up!","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"not"}]},{"text":"Si je foire, quel est le pire qui puisse se passer ?","en":"If I screw up, what's the worst that can happen?","words":[{"g":"if, whether"},{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"which"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"worse, worst"},{"g":"who"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to pass"}]},{"text":"Le match a fini en foire d'empoigne.","en":"The game ended in a free-for-all.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"match, game"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to finish","l":"finir"},{"g":"in / of it"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to grab","l":"empoigner"}]}]}